<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA OFFERS 9 BLN LEVS 3-MTH DISCOUNT T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA OFFERS 9 BLN LEVS 3-MTH DISCOUNT T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will</p>
<p>offer nine billion levs of three-month discount T-bills with no</p>
<p>minimum acceptable price set in advance at an auction on</p>
<p>Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3035897001</p>
<p> Maturity		 three months</p>
<p> Par value		9.0 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   May 26</p>
<p> Issue date	     May 28</p>
<p> Maturity date	  August 27</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
